            "name": "ceb32f13",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "**Managed Spend** is the share of *addressable, paid* spend under active sourcing governance — dollars deliberately put on a contract or competitively bid — versus the unmanaged tail that leaks off-contract.\n",
                "\n",
                "Flagging logic:\n",
                "\n",
                "- **paid** (`payment_status='PAID'`)\n",
                "- **addressable** (excludes regulated/single-source suppliers)\n",
                "- **contracted** (`contract_id IS NOT NULL`)\n",
                "- **sourced** (`sourcing_event_id IS NOT NULL`)\n",
                "\n",
                "```py\n",
                "MANAGED = CONTRACTED OR SOURCED\n",
                "```"
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
